OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fthis evening with some sunny spells
OL,7,Fand remaining dry overnight with clear
OL,8,Fspells. Variable amounts of cloud and
OL,9,Flight winds for all. A few fog patches
OL,10,Fpossible.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA bright start for many but
OL,13,Fincreasing amounts of cloud across the
OL,14,Fnorth of the region during the
OL,15,Fmorning. Feeling very warm in the
OL,16,Fsunshine with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
