OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FMostly
OL,6,Fsettled over the coming days with
OL,7,Fplenty of sunshine. Very warm, with
OL,8,Ftemperatures rising further and
OL,9,Fbecoming hot locally by Wednesday. A
OL,10,Ffew showers on Thursday, and cooling
OL,11,Fdown.
